From 7345fc78710a6712ae169842f8c2b598af2bbfa9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reuben olinsky <reubeno@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:21:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove eMudhra emSign roots from webpki-roots 0.25

Remove the emSign Root CA - C1, emSign Root CA - G1, emSign ECC Root CA - G3, and emSign ECC Root CA - C3 comments and TrustAnchor records from the crate's root certificate set to enforce Azure Linux's eMudhra certificate exclusion policy.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
